  - id: spiritbinder
    displayName: Spiritbinder
    rank: D
    parent: 
    description: 'Binds restless spirits to its will. Spirit Lash fires 1 more bolt in a fan. Summon skills deal 15% more damage. New skill: Call Spirits (level 16).'
